    ## SETUP INSTRUCTIONS

### 1. Install XAMPP/WAMP/MAMP
- Download from official website
- Start Apache and MySQL

### 2. Create Database
```bash
# Open phpMyAdmin (http://localhost/phpmyadmin)
# Create new database named 'giftify_db'
# Import schema.sql file
```

### 3. Update config.php
```php
define('DB_HOST', 'localhost');
define('DB_USER', 'root');        // Your MySQL username
define('DB_PASS', '');            // Your MySQL password
define('DB_NAME', 'giftify_db');
```

### 4. Create Admin User
Run this PHP script once to create admin:
```php
<?php
// create_admin.php
require_once 'php/config.php';
$conn = getDBConnection();
$hashedPassword = password_hash('admin123', PASSWORD_DEFAULT);
$stmt = $conn->prepare("INSERT INTO users (name, email, password, is_admin) VALUES (?, ?, ?, ?)");
$stmt->execute(['Admin', 'admin@giftify.com', $hashedPassword, 1]);
echo "Admin user created!";
?>

### 6. Access the Application
- Frontend: http://localhost/giftify-ecommerce/
- Admin Login: admin@giftify.com / admin123

